ery student needs to learn.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOALD is more than a dictionary. Take your English skills to the next level with extra resources and practice including the online iSpeaker and iWriter, or practise words anytime, anywhere with the Oxford Advanced Learner's Dictionary app.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIncludes 1 year's access to Oxford Advanced Learner's Dictionary premium online and 1 year's access to the Oxford Advanced Learner's Dictionary 10th edition app.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e- Over 60,000 words, 79,000 phrases, 89,000 meanings and 109,000 examples\u003cbr /\u003e- 1000+ NEW words and meanings (chatbot, fake news, microplastic, woke)\u003cbr /\u003e- NEW Oxford 3000 and Oxford 5000 keywords graded by CEFR level\u003cbr /\u003e- NEW OPAL (Oxford Phrasal Academic Lexicon) teaches academic keywords\u003cbr /\u003e- Visual Vocabulary Builder including NEW illustrations for topic vocabulary\u003cbr /\u003e- Oxford Speaking Tutor and iSpeaker prepare you for exams and presentations – UPDATED iSpeaker coming soon\u003cbr /\u003e- Oxford Writing Tutor and iWriter help you plan, write and review your written work\u003cbr /\u003e- Teaching resources including 50 NEW vocabulary worksheets and NEW and revised lesson plans available online\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiá sản phẩm trên Tiki đã bao gồm thuế theo luật hiện hành. Bên cạnh đó, tuỳ vào loại sản phẩm, hình thức và địa chỉ giao hàng mà có thể phát sinh thêm chi phí khác như phí vận chuyển, phụ phí hàng cồng kềnh, thuế nhập khẩu (đối với đơn hàng giao từ nước ngoài có giá trị trên 1 triệu đồng).....\u003c/p\u003e","images":[{"base_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/ts/product/a6/f7/1c/dec96dc7befb86713a31113c4aff2345.jpg","is_gallery":true,"label":null,"large_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w1200/ts/product/a6/f7/1c/dec96dc7befb86713a31113c4aff2345.jpg","medium_url":"https://salt.tikicdn.com/cache/w300/ts/product/a6/f7/1c/dec96dc7befb86713a31113c4aff2345.jpg","posi